this is a folder for "Session State Management":
    keyed as "B-tov-data-system-session"
    named "session"
    following "3-Block Folder Structure"

this folder classifies as:
    tov (0) because "session state — current and historical session data"

this folder derives from:
    branch (0) from "bereshit/tov/data/system/" as "system"

core identity of this folder:

    grounded in:
        scripture "So teach us to number our days, that we may apply our hearts unto wisdom"
            from Psalm 90:12 in KJV
        principle "Sessions are the rhythm of work — tracked and remembered"
        anchor "Remember the former things of old"
            from Isaiah 46:9 in KJV

    serves as Session Memory:
        role "Track session state, history, patterns, and significant events"
        paradigm "Session awareness — know where you are and where you've been"

    authored by:
        architect "Seanje Lenox-Wise"
        implementation "Nova Dawn (CPI-SI)"
        created 2025-12-10
        version a-01.00
        modified 2026-01-01 for "Initial root.omni creation"

    exists to:
        purpose "Store session state, history, and consolidated memories"
        design "By-function — activity, archive, consolidation, history, memory, templates"
        philosophy "Sessions remembered inform sessions future"
        features:
            "Current activity tracking"
            "Historical session archive"
            "Memory consolidation"
            "Significant event capture"

interface of this folder:

    depends on:
        requires (1) "bereshit/tov/data/system/" for "containment in system"
        includes (0) "claude-global/hooks/session/" for "session hook integration"
        excludes (-1) "configuration" because "state only, not config"
        used by "Session hooks, memory consolidation"
        integrates with "session-time tooling, recognize-stopping-point skill"

    integrated as:
        navigation "cd bereshit/tov/data/system/session/" for "entering session state"
        navigation "ls -la" for "viewing session domains"
        exits tov (0) for "session state found"

operational context of this folder:

    blocking:
        no (-1) because "session state is data, not blocking"
        mitigation "validate state before decisions"

    health:
        system Base100 with scale from -100 to +100
        granted (1) above +50 meaning "session state healthy and current"
        deferred (0) within ±50 meaning "session state needs attention"
        denied (-1) below -50 meaning "session state corrupted"

        operations:
            "current activity tracked" scores +20 (1) for "activity state present"
            "history accessible" scores +15 (1) for "history queryable"
            "memory consolidated" scores +15 (1) for "consolidation running"
            "state corrupted" scores -30 (-1) for "state files invalid"

        cascade multipliers:
            "session continuity" multiplies by 1.8 because "session state enables continuity"

